  "answer": "Corvina Airways does not offer bassinets for infants. However, you can travel with your baby on your lap, provided they pay 10% of the adult fare plus taxes. Each adult may travel with only one lap infant; a second infant must have their own seat at the child fare. Make sure to check with us for any additional requirements or availability on your specific flight.",
